  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Glasgow Mathematical Journal (2026), 1–10 — We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori–Hecke algebras associated with the crystallographic Coxeter groups of types An, Bn and Dn.\n\n**Glasgow Mathematical Journal (2026), 1–10**\n\n*RESEARCH ARTICLE*\n\n10 pp, 12 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori–Hecke algebras associated with the crystallographic Coxeter groups of types An, Bn and Dn. In types B and D, it is new and generalises a known construction in type A employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys–Murphy elements.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Iwahori-Hecke algebras; Introduction; Coxeter groups; Iwahori-Hecke algebras and multiplicative Jucy; Trace functional and a pairing on H(W,S); `Full twist' and Jucys-Murphy elements; Some central elements in the classical Iwahori; Markov traces; Markov traces via Jucys-Murphy elements; General Markov traces in types B, D; Geometric Markov traces",
      "lang": "en",
